# BuildKit reads this file in place of a .dockerignore when the image is built with -f tools/workbench/Dockerfile.
# Everything is left out of the build context except what the image needs. Nothing under reference/ or etl/ is sent.
*
!core/pyproject.toml
!core/schemalyser/
!fixtures/
!tools/sqlserver/harness.py
!tools/workbench/requirements.txt
!site/dist/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.*
